---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="bruhs: one window for your whole day"
  description="A local-first, keyboard-native agent for your whole day: coding agents, tasks, calendar, meetings, people, notes, money and health in one window. Free, open source, for macOS."
  ogDescription="Agents, tasks, calendar, meetings, people, notes, money and health. One ⌘K away, on your machine."
  path="/"
  current="home"
  palette
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1 class="display">One window for your whole day.</h1>
          <p class="lede">Coding agents, tasks, calendar and meetings, a keystroke apart. On your Mac, not our cloud.</p>
          <div class="get-row">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/bryantleft/bruhs-ai/releases/latest/download/Bruhs-macOS-arm64.dmg" data-download>Download for macOS</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/bryantleft/bruhs-ai">GitHub</a>
          </div>
          <p class="fine">Free, MIT licensed. macOS 13+ on Apple silicon.</p>
        </div>
        <canvas class="bruh bruh-hero" data-bruh="hero" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section tour" id="surfaces" aria-label="What's inside">
      <div class="surfaces" data-surfaces>
        <div class="wrap tabs-row">
          <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Surfaces">
            <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-agents" aria-controls="agents" aria-selected="true" type="button"><span class="dot dot-agent" aria-hidden="true"></span>Agents</button>
            <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-tasks" aria-controls="tasks" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" type="button"><span class="dot dot-tasks" aria-hidden="true"></span>Tasks</button>
            <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-calendar" aria-controls="calendar" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" type="button"><span class="dot dot-calendar" aria-hidden="true"></span>Calendar</button>
            <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-meetings" aria-controls="meetings" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" type="button"><span class="dot dot-meetings" aria-hidden="true"></span>Meetings</button>
            <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-people" aria-controls="people" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" type="button"><span class="dot dot-people" aria-hidden="true"></span>People</button>
            <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-notes" aria-controls="notes" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" type="button"><span class="dot dot-notes" aria-hidden="true"></span>Notes</button>
            <button class="tab" role="tab" id="tab-life" aria-controls="life" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" type="button"><span class="dot dot-life" aria-hidden="true"></span>Life</button>
          </div>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost cycle-toggle" type="button" data-tour-toggle hidden><svg class="icon-pause" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="1" width="3" height="10" rx="1"/><rect x="7" y="1" width="3" height="10" rx="1"/></svg><svg class="icon-play" viewBox="0 0 12 12" width="12" height="12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 1.5v9a.5.5 0 0 0 .76.43l7.2-4.5a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.86l-7.2-4.5A.5.5 0 0 0 3 1.5Z"/></svg><span class="cycle-label">Pause tour</span></button>
        </div>

        <div class="stage panels">
          <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="agents" aria-labelledby="tab-agents" tabindex="0">
            <figure class="window">
              <img src="/shots/hero-1440.webp" srcset="/shots/hero-1440.webp 1440w, /shots/hero-2880.webp 2880w" sizes="(min-width: 1168px) 1120px, calc(100vw - 48px)" width="1440" height="900" decoding="async"
                alt="The bruhs app: a sidebar of Claude and Codex threads across several projects, and an open thread where Claude reads session.rs, runs cargo test, explains a race on a shared test clock, and shows a two-file diff.">
            </figure>
            <p class="caption">Claude Code and Codex threads, with every tool call, diff and a terminal.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="tasks" aria-labelledby="tab-tasks" tabindex="0" hidden>
            <figure class="window">
              <img src="/shots/tasks-1168.webp" srcset="/shots/tasks-1168.webp 1168w, /shots/tasks-2336.webp 2336w" sizes="(min-width: 1168px) 1120px, calc(100vw - 48px)" width="1168" height="730" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                alt="The Today view: a briefing, the current focus block and the rest of the day's schedule, a ranked focus queue with priorities and estimates, and columns for overdue work, waiting on, follow-ups and decisions.">
            </figure>
            <p class="caption">Today: what's due, what's blocked, and who you're waiting on.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="calendar" aria-labelledby="tab-calendar" tabindex="0" hidden>
            <figure class="window">
              <img src="/shots/calendar-1168.webp" srcset="/shots/calendar-1168.webp 1168w, /shots/calendar-2336.webp 2336w" sizes="(min-width: 1168px) 1120px, calc(100vw - 48px)" width="1168" height="730" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                alt="A week in the bruhs calendar: meetings, blue focus blocks for tasks like the flaky auth test and the launch post, green workouts, and evening plans, with a line marking the current time on Wednesday.">
            </figure>
            <p class="caption">“Plan my day” turns estimates into focus blocks around your meetings.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="meetings" aria-labelledby="tab-meetings" tabindex="0" hidden>
            <figure class="window">
              <img src="/shots/meetings-1168.webp" srcset="/shots/meetings-1168.webp 1168w, /shots/meetings-2336.webp 2336w" sizes="(min-width: 1168px) 1120px, calc(100vw - 48px)" width="1168" height="730" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                alt="A recorded meeting: the end of a speaker-labeled transcript, then a summary, four action items with due dates, the decisions made, and topics.">
            </figure>
            <p class="caption">Meeting notes without a bot in the call, transcribed on your Mac.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="people" aria-labelledby="tab-people" tabindex="0" hidden>
            <figure class="window">
              <img src="/shots/people-1168.webp" srcset="/shots/people-1168.webp 1168w, /shots/people-2336.webp 2336w" sizes="(min-width: 1168px) 1120px, calc(100vw - 48px)" width="1168" height="730" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                alt="A person in bruhs: company, role and contact details, private notes, a suggested follow-up, and a list of commitments, reminders and past interactions.">
            </figure>
            <p class="caption">A CRM that fills itself in from your meetings and messages.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="notes" aria-labelledby="tab-notes" tabindex="0" hidden>
            <figure class="window">
              <img src="/shots/notes-1168.webp" srcset="/shots/notes-1168.webp 1168w, /shots/notes-2336.webp 2336w" sizes="(min-width: 1168px) 1120px, calc(100vw - 48px)" width="1168" height="730" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                alt="The Notes view: tagged Markdown documents such as a pilot plan and a launch checklist, and saved web clips that keep their source.">
            </figure>
            <p class="caption">Docs and web clips your agent can read.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="panel" role="tabpanel" id="life" aria-labelledby="tab-life" tabindex="0" hidden>
            <figure class="window">
              <img src="/shots/life-1168.webp" srcset="/shots/life-1168.webp 1168w, /shots/life-2336.webp 2336w" sizes="(min-width: 1168px) 1120px, calc(100vw - 48px)" width="1168" height="730" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
                alt="The finance side of Life: net worth, 30-day spend and expected income, the agent-access and redaction switches, a list of accounts, and recent transactions.">
            </figure>
            <p class="caption">Money and health, hidden from the agent until you opt in.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-label="Providers and privacy">
      <div class="wrap duo">
        <div id="subs" class="duo-col">
          <h2 class="h2" tabindex="-1">Bring your own sub.</h2>
          <ul class="logins">
            <li><img src="/logos/claude.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20"><code><span class="p">$</span> claude auth login</code></li>
            <li><img src="/logos/openai.svg" alt="" width="20" height="20"><code><span class="p">$</span> codex login</code></li>
          </ul>
          <p class="muted">No API keys, no resold tokens.</p>
        </div>

        <div id="privacy" class="duo-col">
          <h2 class="h2" tabindex="-1">Stays on your Mac.</h2>
          <p class="muted">No bruhs cloud. Only your messages to Claude or Codex leave, plus Google Calendar if you connect it and update checks you can turn off.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="keys" aria-labelledby="keys-title">
      <div class="wrap keys">
        <div class="keys-head">
          <h2 class="h2" id="keys-title" tabindex="-1">Built for the keyboard.</h2>
          <p class="muted hint-key">Press one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="keys-top">
          <div class="bigkey" data-keys="mod+k"><span class="combo"><kbd><span class="mod">⌘</span></kbd><kbd>K</kbd></span><span>Command bar</span></div>
          <div class="bigkey" data-keys="mod+n"><span class="combo"><kbd><span class="mod">⌘</span></kbd><kbd>N</kbd></span><span>New thread</span></div>
          <div class="bigkey" data-keys="mod+shift+y"><span class="combo"><kbd><span class="mod">⌘</span></kbd><kbd>⇧</kbd><kbd>Y</kbd></span><span>Today</span></div>
          <div class="bigkey" data-keys="mod+shift+space"><span class="combo"><kbd><span class="mod">⌘</span></kbd><kbd>⇧</kbd><kbd>Space</kbd></span><span>Capture</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section closing" id="get" aria-labelledby="get-title">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2 class="display display-sm" id="get-title" tabindex="-1">Close the other twelve tabs.</h2>
        <div class="get-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/bryantleft/bruhs-ai/releases/latest/download/Bruhs-macOS-arm64.dmg" data-download>Download for macOS</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://github.com/bryantleft/bruhs-ai/releases">All releases</a>
        </div>
        <p class="source"><span class="p">$</span> git clone https://github.com/bryantleft/bruhs-ai &amp;&amp; cd bruhs-ai &amp;&amp; scripts/dev.sh</p>
      </div>
      <canvas class="bruh bruh-peek" data-bruh="peek" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    </section>
  </main>

  <dialog slot="after" class="palette-dialog" aria-label="Jump to">
    <div class="palette" data-palette data-palette-mode="dialog">
      <div class="palette-input">
        <span class="prompt" aria-hidden="true">›</span>
        <label class="sr-only" for="dialog-palette-input">Jump to a part of bruhs</label>
        <input id="dialog-palette-input" type="text" role="combobox" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="dialog-palette-list" aria-autocomplete="list" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Jump to…">
        <kbd>esc</kbd>
      </div>
      <ul class="palette-list" id="dialog-palette-list" role="listbox" aria-label="Commands"></ul>
    </div>
  </dialog>
</Base>

<script>
  import "../scripts/site.js";
</script>
